            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "When true, the entire batch is rejected if ANY entry fails schema validation — nothing is persisted and the seed file is left untouched. Use this for trusted, all-or-nothing imports. Default false preserves the legacy behaviour of accepting valid entries and reporting the rest as warnings."
